   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## A shader as the material of your regions\n\nNo model in this workflow: it shows the picture a model would paint from.\n\n**shader 1** has the regions and the picture connected. `which regions` = `W_F1_*`, so it draws in the first-floor windows and\nleaves the rest of the picture as it is. **shader 2** takes that picture on `image0` and draws on the second floor: a\nsecond kubakub shader behind the first is a second layer, `on_picture` is its blend.\n\n**With a model:** connect the `images` of the last shader to **`material`** of **kubakub region sampler**: every region\nthe plan paints starts from the shader's picture. Its `masks` on **`change`** say how much each place may change.\n`region_materials_klein.json` is this workflow with the sampler. In **kubakub region video sampler** the same clip on\n`material` moves the animated regions.\n"
   ]
  }
